son field was asked.","+- TT 16 s window: in_window 2.85 s (download 0.92, solve 1.31). Mastery 3 sets / 300 ids, 28 s window: in_window 5.59 s (download","+  1.37, solve 3.62). Both CORRECT first try (BR10-007 / -001 / -004).","+"," ## GM answer conventions learned"," | Field family | Accepted form | Rejected (never resubmit) |"," |---|---|---|"]},{"oldStart":162,"oldLines":6,"newStart":175,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | metadata_version | BSJB root string `v4.0.30319` | net8.0 / TFM / assembly version |"," | config_* | values verbatim from the decoded HCFG JSON (mutex keeps ONE backslash) | JSON-escaped `\\\\` |"," | hcfg_version | header byte 4 as a decimal integer | — |","+| has_hcfg_section (D10, enum) | `true` when a section is literally named `.hcfg` (ELF Zig + PE Zig both `true`) | — |"," | hcfg_offset (`kind: integer`, D9) | decimal FILE offset of the stored blob's first byte (base64 text start: `30696`), single+TT+Mastery x5 | — (not tried: VA 0x4077e8, struct 0x77e0, `strings -t d` 30695) |"," | xor_key_hex | HCFG header byte 5 as `0x%02x` (D8: 0x51/0x61/0x71/0x31 for d04-d07) | — |"," | compression_methods (jar, `kind: json`) | sorted distinct ZIP `compress_type` ids, compact: `[0,8]` | — |"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/testpwn/huntress-2026/reference/techniques/binary-reverse-engineering.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RuKfFc3FTFbxCf5rjyz2VV","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
